   result: 已是 MEAN, 无变化\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: v2 RE n=25 结果推翻 attenuation 叙述，升级为 \\\\\\\"confusability is task-inherent, not\\\\n    prompt artifact\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: v2 prompt n=25 实验显示 Δ=25.5pp (CI [22.4,28.6], p<0.0001, r=−0.919)，效应巨大且高度显著。此前\\\\n    n=5 不显著是 underpowered + narrow BCS contrast (0.21 vs 0.44) 导致的伪阴性。v2 不消除效应意味着\\\\n    confusability 是 task-inherent property，直接回应 \\\\\\\"prompt artifact\\\\\\\" reviewer concern。论文\\\\n    §4.3、Introduction、Appendix G 均需更新，paper_framing.md 的 prompt sensitivity concern\\\\n    从 partially addressed 升级为 addressed。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_v2_re_n25\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: Δ=25.5pp, r=−0.919, p<0.0001\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 exp-017 GPT-4o-mini：TUM proxy 未部署，AutoDL 无法访问 OpenAI API，不值得搭建基础设施\\\\n  rationale: AutoDL 服务器无法直接访问 OpenAI API（TUM proxy service not deployed）。距 DDL 9 天，debug\\\\n    基础设施的 ROI 太低。当前 2 模型族 (Qwen3-32B + LLaMA-3.1-8B) 满足跨模型验证基本要求，Discussion 已有 model\\\\n    coverage limitation 表述。exp-018 batch composition 的 practical contribution 优先级更高。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp017_gpt4o_mini_fewrel\\\\n    role: cancelled\\\\n    result: 'BLOCKED: TUM proxy not deployed'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-018 成功：confusability-aware batching 在 RE 上 +1.44pp (显著)，无 merge amplification。进入论文收尾阶段。\\\\n  rationale: Graph coloring BCS 最小化分组 accuracy 0.8021 > random 0.7877±0.0178 (超 95%\\\\n    CI 上界 0.7967)，single_pass 0.5042 验证 schema overload。RE closed-set 无 merge amplification，与\\\\n    NER SDGD 失败形成对比。论文从纯诊断升级为诊断+缓解，直接回应 W6 (§5 过短) 和 SDGD 缺 actionable takeaway 的审稿意见。距\\\\n    DDL 9 天，核心实验已全部完成，进入写作集成 + final review。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_confusability_batch_composition\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: aware=0.8021 > random=0.7877, single_pass=0.5042\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: D042 修正：exp-018 confusability-aware 与 random 无显著差异 (p≈0.22)，oracle routing\\\\n    使 \\\\\\\"无 merge\\\\\\\" 为空真。§5 写法降级。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 审查发现：(1) 统计检验错误——单点 vs mean CI 不是合法检验，排名法 p≈0.19，z\\\\n    检验 p=0.22；(2) 实验用 oracle routing（每个样本只路由到含 gold type 的 batch），根本没有 merge 步骤，\\\\\\\"无\\\\n    merge amplification\\\\\\\"是空真。+29.8pp 是纯 count 效应（80→10 types），confusability-aware 额外收益\\\\n    +1.44pp 不显著。§5 写法从\\\\\\\"诊断+缓解\\\\\\\"降级为\\\\\\\"RE oracle routing decomposition 有效（count 效应）+ confusability-aware\\\\n    方向一致但不显著\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_confusability_batch_composition\\\\n    role: re-evaluated\\\\n    result: aware vs random p≈0.22 n.s.; oracle routing, no actual merge\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27674, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01N6BRmGrcwiu7gm7j98SRfJ","session_id":"08b36851-eb50-4863-8dbd-f6e8edd972e2","uuid":"b879c579-73fb-4078-99db-8411b491034e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:07:45.622Z"}
