\\\n    section: sdgd_negative\\\\n    context: result_statement\\\\n  id: C031\\\\n  evidence:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd_r2\\\\n    metric: per_type recall=0.5856, precision=0.194; single_pass recall=0.3679, precision=0.5631\\\\n    tier: 1\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- text: A natural remedy is to resolve merge conflicts using model confidence.  Our\\\\n    v2 merge ranks competing predictions by the LLM's self-reported confidence and\\\\n    retains only the highest-scoring candidate fo\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: sdgd_negative\\\\n    context: result_statement\\\\n  id: C032\\\\n  evidence:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sdgd_v2_fewnerd\\\\n    metric: v2 sdgd_zero F1=0.2407 vs v1 0.2514, confidence-gated merge did not improve\\\\n    tier: 1\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C033\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: results\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: 80-pool→16-sub slope = -0.401, CI [-0.701, -0.069], r = -0.221, p = 0.027\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: []\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C034\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: results\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: Independent 16-rel slope = -0.449, CI [-0.552, -0.346], r = -0.637, p < 1e-12\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: []\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C035\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: results\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: Full 80-rel slope = -0.151, CI [-0.930, +0.657], r = -0.082, p = 0.698, underpowered\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: []\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C036\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: results\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  text: 16-rel extreme-batch Δ = +11.45pp, CI [7.66, 15.48]\\\\n  type: quantitative\\\\n  evidence: []\\\\n  decisions: []\\\\n  deprecated: false\\\\n- id: C037\\\\n  location:\\\\n    section: results\\\\n    paragraph: 0\\\\n    sentence: 0\\\\n  te